@fufu1437/dsh-model-commands README · After a DSH update：An upgrade can rebuild the profile and drop third-party bundles: the dependency
and its `dsh.profile.bundles` entry disappear even though `cordis.patch.yml`
survives, so the plugin silently stops loading. Re-run the install step above;
the table at `<DSH_HOME>/model-commands/skills.json` is never touched.
